Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:01.51,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.67,0:18:03.19,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这... 这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.59,0:18:07.04,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！这是画具里的调色盘吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.35,0:18:09.31,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是要画的？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:11.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道用法的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好机会啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.29,0:18:15.97,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:19.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:24.62,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,Wing！诶...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.43,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然还没摸透...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,先用用看吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.50,0:18:38.46,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,二色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:40.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:40.10,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:42.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.17,0:18:42.49,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:48.11,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.03,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:54.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:57.06,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你要我怎么弄啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:58.73,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.91,PrinAir,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:04.18,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 叫这个名字啊... 不对啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.53,0:19:09.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊！融合调色盘能提升大伙的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.26,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的啊... 看招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:13.69,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.99,0:19:16.80,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你说提升力量？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:22.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们也来！乱暴兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.29,0:19:25.93,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:28.63,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.51,0:19:31.99,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,乱暴...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:33.88,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:39.16,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,全色合一！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:40.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,融合调色盘！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.45,0:19:40.79,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Mix Palette！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,红色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.23,0:19:42.07,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Red！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,黄色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.93,0:19:45.09,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Yellow！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:47.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Blue！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:50.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,白色！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:50.50,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}White！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:57.96,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,搅拌搅拌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,色彩填充！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.64,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Colour Charge！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:23.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,光美·绚烂彩虹冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:23.53,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}Precure Titanic Rainbow Attack！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,豁然开朗
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.25,0:20:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}豁然开朗
